{"results":[{"url":"https://trumpwhitehouse.archives.gov/","final_url":"https://trumpwhitehouse.archives.gov/","title":"The White House – The White House","description":null,"language":"en","text":"## Initiatives\n\n### Peace to Prosperity\n\nOur initiative created a path to prosperity, security, and dignity for all involved. The potential for both the Israelis and the Palestinians and the region is unlimited.\n\nOur initiative created a path to prosperity, security, and dignity for all involved. The potential for both the Israelis and the Palestinians and the region is unlimited.","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":324.9877140042372,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}